      "text": "2008 MySQL search  \u2192  2010 Earlybird rebuild on Lucene  \u2192  2012 at scale (500M tweets/day)  \u2192  2019 15s indexing lag exposed  \u2192  2020 skip lists cut latency to ~1s",
